{"availability":"available","full":"ohad6k/emulo","name":"emulo","description":"Mine your Claude Code and Codex logs into a local you.md agent profile.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":294,"forks":31,"created":"2026-07-08T11:42:32Z","updated":"2026-10-02T14:37:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://emulo.vercel.app","topics":["agent-memory","agent-skills","ai","ai-agents","ai-coding","ai-memory","claude","claude-code","codex","context-engineering","cursor","developer-tools","llm","local-first","mcp","mcp-server","memory","model-context-protocol","opencode","personalization"],"demo":"https://emulo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.081Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.081Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.081Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.081Z","stars":294,"forks":31}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Mine the messages you typed to your coding agents into a you.md profile, every rule with dated receipts, and install it where your agent can read it.","Your real coding-agent sessions already contain the rules you never wrote down: what “done” means, what you reject on sight, how you debug, how you design UI, and how you write when you are actually working.","Emulo mines selected evidence from those sessions (Claude Code, Codex, Copilot CLI, OpenCode, and Google Antigravity logs out of the box) into a private working profile, where every rule carries dated quotes from your own messages, and installs it where your agent can read it. The agent mining flow writes separate files for work, design, writing, and video, so a host can load only the one that fits the task."],"features":["The usage report and emulo verify are text matches on your own messages. They count and they trace quotes. They cannot tell you why anything happened.","Loading means a host puts the profile in front of its model. Which hosts were seen doing that is in the support matrix.","Whether a loaded profile makes the agent's work better is not shown. It is the aim, not a result.","An appended mined profile changed what the model produced, compared with no profile.","In a 60 run study with every prediction written down in advance (August 2026), the mined profile did not separate from an invented profile of the same length on any of 9 comparisons. emulo.vercel.app/placebo"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"88fe5c1b361599e955f1a6370e78d2434a2c04c3a0be006196afc00caf74713e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.185Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.185Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Mine the messages you typed to your coding agents into a you.md profile, every rule with dated receipts, and install it where your agent can read it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Emulo is MIT licensed, free, and works without an account or a sign-in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Separately, the site offers one optional paid service, a hand edit of a profile you already mined, and you never need it to use Emulo.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Your agent must show the cost and wait for approval before model work.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"88fe5c1b361599e955f1a6370e78d2434a2c04c3a0be006196afc00caf74713e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.185Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T14:37:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ohad6k/emulo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:17.186Z","hash":"88fe5c1b36